WEBVTT

00:18.229 --> 00:19.436
Hey.
嘿。

00:19.505 --> 00:20.781
What's taking so long?
什么事要花这么长时间？

00:20.850 --> 00:22.539
I never got my fries.
我从来没有得到过我的薯条。

00:22.608 --> 00:24.746
Why doesn't my father love me?
为什么我的父亲不爱我？

00:24.815 --> 00:26.643
[customers complaining]
【顾客投诉】

00:26.712 --> 00:28.057
- Hey, Squidward.
- Quit it.
- 嘿，章鱼哥。
- 退出吧。

00:28.126 --> 00:29.264
- Hey, Squidward.
- Quit it.
- 嘿，章鱼哥。
- 退出吧。

00:29.333 --> 00:32.333
- Hey, Squidward.
- Quit it!
- 嘿，章鱼哥。
- 戒掉吧！

00:32.402 --> 00:34.471
Mr. Squidward, clean up
in the head.
章鱼哥先生，清理干净
在头脑中。

00:35.988 --> 00:37.677
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

00:37.746 --> 00:39.471
Also, clean up here.
还有，把这里打扫干净。

00:39.539 --> 00:40.850
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

00:40.919 --> 00:41.919
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

00:41.953 --> 00:43.574
I said clean up.
我说清理。

00:43.643 --> 00:44.815
- Squidward!
- Squidward.
- 章鱼哥！
- 章鱼哥。

00:44.884 --> 00:46.712
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

00:47.919 --> 00:51.091
Hey, Squidward. Hey, Squidward.
Hey, Squidward. Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。嘿，章鱼哥。
嘿，章鱼哥。嘿，章鱼哥。

00:51.160 --> 00:52.953
- Squidward!
- Hey, Squidward, Squidward,
- 章鱼哥！
- 嘿，章鱼哥，章鱼哥，

00:53.022 --> 00:54.643
hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

00:54.712 --> 00:56.367
Oh, no...
哦，不...

00:56.436 --> 01:00.677
Don't just lay there.
Clean up. Clean up. Clean up!
别只是躺在那里。
清理。清理。清理！

01:00.746 --> 01:03.402
Aah!
啊啊！

01:07.367 --> 01:09.160
It was just a dream.
这只是一个梦。

01:09.229 --> 01:13.884
Just a horrible, realistic,
totally on point dream.
只是一个可怕的、现实的、
完全符合梦想。

01:13.953 --> 01:16.539
Oh, I can't believe
I'm dreaming about work
哦，我不敢相信
我梦见工作

01:16.608 --> 01:18.815
when there's so many
more interesting things
当有这么多的时候
更多有趣的事情

01:18.884 --> 01:20.229
I could be doing.
我可以做。

01:20.298 --> 01:22.781
Just look at
my unfinished painting.
看看
我未完成的画。

01:22.850 --> 01:25.643
And my unfinished symphony.
还有我未完成的交响曲。

01:25.712 --> 01:27.539
And my uneaten strudel.
还有我没吃过的馅饼。

01:28.988 --> 01:30.953
My strudel!
我的馅饼！

01:31.022 --> 01:33.091
Just tasted like pie to me.
对我来说尝起来就像馅饼。

01:33.160 --> 01:35.367
It's a strudel, you barbarian.
这是馅饼，你这个野蛮人。

01:35.436 --> 01:37.229
Just look at those
pastry layers.
看看那些
糕点层。

01:40.574 --> 01:42.195
- Oh, yeah.
- Ohh...
- 哦，是的。
- 哦...

01:42.264 --> 01:45.746
I just woke up and the day's
already a disaster.
我刚刚醒来，这一天
已经是一场灾难了。

01:45.815 --> 01:48.402
I can't face
the Krusty Krab today.
我无法面对
今天的蟹堡王。

01:48.471 --> 01:53.367
I am staying home and diving
into an ocean of Squidward.
我呆在家里潜水
进入章鱼哥的海洋。

01:53.436 --> 01:55.160
[jungle sounds]
[丛林的声音]

01:55.229 --> 01:58.850
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:11.919 --> 02:13.643
Ahh...
啊...

02:13.712 --> 02:15.781
What the...
什么...

02:15.850 --> 02:17.884
Oh... [muttering]
哦...[低语]

02:17.953 --> 02:20.471
Any more of that layer pie?
还有那层馅饼吗？

02:20.539 --> 02:22.988
Get out!
出去！

02:23.057 --> 02:26.539
Now to get rid of
the other monkey on my back.
现在要摆脱
我背上的另一只猴子。

02:28.126 --> 02:29.402
[ah-ah-ahem]
[啊啊啊咳]

02:29.471 --> 02:31.919
[clearing throat]
[清嗓子]

02:34.160 --> 02:35.677
Krusty Krab.
蟹堡王。

02:35.746 --> 02:37.229
[coughing]
[咳嗽]

02:37.298 --> 02:40.712
Oh, Mr. Krabs, it's...
[gagging, coughing]
噢，蟹老板，这是……
[作呕，咳嗽]

02:40.781 --> 02:42.539
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

02:42.608 --> 02:43.884
Mr. Squidward?
章鱼哥先生？

02:43.953 --> 02:45.136
What are you doing on the phone?
你在打电话做什么？

02:45.160 --> 02:47.539
You should be working.
- [hacking]
你应该工作了。
- [黑客攻击]

02:47.608 --> 02:52.264
Can't work.
Too...[hacking] sick.
无法工作。
太……[黑客]生病了。

02:52.333 --> 02:54.712
Ah-choo!
啊呼！

02:54.781 --> 02:56.471
You do sound pretty bad.
你听起来确实很糟糕。

02:56.539 --> 02:58.298
Are you sure
you're too sick to work?
你确定吗
你病得太重了，无法工作吗？

02:58.367 --> 03:01.539
Ha ha.
I mean, I mean...[coughing]
哈哈。
我是说，我是说……[咳嗽]

03:01.608 --> 03:03.505
positive.
积极的。

03:03.574 --> 03:05.057
Hmm...
唔...

03:07.471 --> 03:08.850
Too sick, hey?
太有病了吧？

03:08.919 --> 03:11.402
Oh, I got the cure
for what ails you.
哦，我找到了解药
是什么让你不舒服。

03:11.471 --> 03:14.195
Well, you just rest up,
Mr. Squidward.
那你就好好休息吧
章鱼哥先生。

03:14.264 --> 03:17.298
I'll take care of everything.
我会处理好一切。

03:17.367 --> 03:18.884
Okay, bye, talk to you...
好吧，再见，再跟你聊聊……

03:18.953 --> 03:21.677
I mean, I mean... [hacking]
我的意思是，我的意思是... [黑客攻击]

03:21.746 --> 03:23.298
[hoarsely]
Bye!
[沙哑]
再见！

03:23.367 --> 03:26.574
No one fake sick on Mr. Krabs
and gets away with it.
没有人对蟹老板假装生病
并侥幸逃脱。

03:29.160 --> 03:30.746
No work for me today.
今天我没有工作。

03:30.815 --> 03:34.712
Mr. Squidward gets to play.
No customers for me to fear.
章鱼哥先生开始玩了。
没有顾客让我害怕。

03:34.781 --> 03:39.850
SpongeBob can take a long
walk along a very sharp pier.
海绵宝宝可能需要很长时间
沿着一个非常陡峭的码头走。

03:39.919 --> 03:41.333
[knock on door]
Huh?
[敲门]
啊？

03:41.402 --> 03:43.712
Oh. That must be
the crudité I ordered.
哦。那一定是
我点的生菜。

03:43.781 --> 03:46.160
Well... oh!
嗯……哦！

03:48.539 --> 03:52.195
Oh, Mr. Krabs.
I didn't see you there.
哦，蟹老板。
我在那儿没看到你。

03:52.264 --> 03:57.471
How thoughtful of you to
visit me in my weakened state.
你想得多么周到
在我虚弱的状态下拜访我。

03:57.539 --> 03:59.953
Oh, think nothing of it,
Mr. Squidward.
哦，别想了，
章鱼哥先生。

04:00.022 --> 04:03.746
You sounded so bad on the phone
I rushed right over
你在电话里的声音听起来很糟糕
我立刻冲了过去

04:03.815 --> 04:06.988
to make sure you were
taking good care of yourself.
确保你是
照顾好自己。

04:07.057 --> 04:09.884
Well, I wouldn't want
to infect anyone,
好吧，我不想
感染任何人，

04:09.953 --> 04:13.126
so you should probably go now.
所以你也许应该现在就走。

04:13.195 --> 04:16.436
Oh, you are in no condition
to be alone.
哦，你没状态
独自一人。

04:16.505 --> 04:18.781
That's why I brought
you some help.
这就是为什么我带来了
你帮忙吧。

04:18.850 --> 04:21.643
Take one of these
and call me in the morning.
采取其中之一
早上给我打电话。

04:21.712 --> 04:23.815
The doctor is in.
医生进来了。

04:23.884 --> 04:25.264
Oh...
哦...

04:25.333 --> 04:27.160
Swaddle, swaddle, swaddle.
襁褓，襁褓，襁褓。

04:28.402 --> 04:30.298
Hush-aby now,
don't strain yourself.
现在安静点，
不要让自己太紧张。

04:34.746 --> 04:37.677
Really, Mr. Krabs,
this isn't necessary.
真的，蟹老板先生，
这是没有必要的。

04:37.746 --> 04:39.298
Of course it is.
当然是。

04:39.367 --> 04:41.712
If I find out you were faking it
如果我发现你是假的

04:41.781 --> 04:45.195
just to get out of work,
I'd have to fire you.
只是为了摆脱工作，
我不得不解雇你。

04:45.264 --> 04:49.712
No faking here.
No, I'm really... [cough] sick.
这里没有造假。
不，我真的……[咳嗽]病了。

04:50.919 --> 04:52.574
Okay, back to the swaddling.
好吧，回到襁褓中。

04:52.643 --> 04:54.126
Aw!
噢！

05:00.160 --> 05:03.091
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

05:04.781 --> 05:06.505
Oh, yes. I like that.
哦是的。我喜欢这样。

05:06.574 --> 05:09.022
Uh-huh, uh-huh.
Indeed.
嗯嗯，嗯嗯。
的确。

05:09.091 --> 05:10.781
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:10.850 --> 05:13.505
Squidward!
You're overexerting yourself.
章鱼哥！
你太用力了。

05:13.574 --> 05:16.333
Now you just rest that sick
little body of yours
现在你就好好休息吧
你小小的身体

05:16.402 --> 05:19.160
while SpongeBob finishes up
your self-portrait for you.
当海绵宝宝结束时
你的自画像。

05:19.229 --> 05:20.815
- But... but... but...
- Ha ha!
- 但是...但是...但是...
- 哈哈！

05:20.884 --> 05:21.953
La la la la!
啦啦啦啦！

05:22.022 --> 05:24.988
Oh, yeah, oh, yeah. Done.
哦，是啊，哦，是啊。完毕。

05:25.057 --> 05:28.091
In my imagination,
you're a helpless little baby.
在我的想象中，
你是一个无助的小婴儿。

05:28.160 --> 05:31.022
Gee, you're sicker
than I thought.
哎呀，你病得更重了
比我想象的要多。

05:31.091 --> 05:32.608
[Squidward vomiting]
【鱿鱼呕吐】

05:32.677 --> 05:33.781
Eh...
呃……

05:40.471 --> 05:42.850
Now just forget
that yellow nuisance
现在只是忘记
那个黄色的麻烦

05:42.919 --> 05:46.160
and lose yourself in music.
并在音乐中迷失自我。

05:46.229 --> 05:47.815
♪
- Squidward!
♪
- 章鱼哥！

05:47.884 --> 05:50.298
You shouldn't be wasting your
breath in your weakened state.
你不应该浪费你的
在你虚弱的状态下呼吸。

05:50.367 --> 05:53.402
Let me blow
the clarinet for you.
让我吹
为你准备的单簧管。

05:53.471 --> 05:55.264
No, no, don't touch my...
♪ ♪
不，不，别碰我的……
♪ ♪

05:55.333 --> 05:57.091
Don't touch my...
别碰我的...

05:57.160 --> 05:59.539
Hmm? Bleh.
唔？布莱赫。

05:59.608 --> 06:01.402
[musical inhale]
[音乐吸气]

06:03.677 --> 06:05.195
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

06:15.195 --> 06:19.471
Ah. The perfect strudel will
make everything all right.
啊。完美的果馅卷将
让一切都好起来。

06:19.539 --> 06:21.505
- Oh, Squidward.
- Oh...
-哦，章鱼哥。
- 哦...

06:21.574 --> 06:23.367
Time to take your temperature.
是时候量体温了。

06:23.436 --> 06:24.919
Get that thing away from my...
把那东西从我的身边拿开……

06:29.850 --> 06:34.402
Ooh! 98.6. Oh, Squidward,
you're all better.
哦！ 98.6。哦，章鱼哥，
你们都好多了。

06:34.471 --> 06:36.953
I'm so happy we can both go
to the Krusty Krab now.
我很高兴我们可以一起走
现在去蟹堡吧。

06:37.022 --> 06:39.057
What? No!
什么？不！

06:39.126 --> 06:42.298
Give me that thing.
You must've read it wrong.
把那个东西给我。
你一定是读错了。

06:42.367 --> 06:43.677
Oh, hey.
What's that over there?
哦，嘿。
那边是什么？

06:43.746 --> 06:47.195
Oh cool. A wall.
哦，酷。一堵墙。

06:47.264 --> 06:49.746
So smooth.
如此顺利。

06:53.022 --> 06:54.402
Well, that was fun.
嗯，那很有趣。

06:54.471 --> 06:56.102
Now, let's check that
thermometer again, shall we?
现在，让我们检查一下
再来一次温度计，好吗？

06:56.126 --> 06:58.264
Here you go.
干得好。

06:59.815 --> 07:01.539
Yikes. A fever.
哎呀。发烧了。

07:01.608 --> 07:03.781
Squidward, we got
to cool you off.
章鱼哥，我们得到了
让你冷静下来。

07:06.781 --> 07:07.919
Stop.
停止。

07:07.988 --> 07:09.574
You're right,
you need it even colder.
你说得对，
你需要更冷的温度。

07:15.884 --> 07:17.333
[shrieking, whimpering]
[尖叫，呜咽]

07:17.402 --> 07:18.850
Thank you.
谢谢。

07:22.160 --> 07:25.091
- Oh, boy.
- There, all better?
- 哦，男孩。
- 怎么样，好些了吗？

07:25.160 --> 07:27.953
N-no, you buffoon.
不——不，你这个小丑。

07:28.022 --> 07:29.195
You're right, Squidward.
你是对的，章鱼哥。

07:29.264 --> 07:31.264
I have been... buffoon.
我一直是……小丑。

07:31.333 --> 07:33.298
W-w-what?
什、什、什么？

07:33.367 --> 07:35.195
I've been treating the symptoms
我一直在治疗症状

07:35.264 --> 07:37.574
instead of the sickness.
而不是疾病。

07:37.643 --> 07:38.688
Stay away from me
with that thing.
离我远点
与那件事。

07:38.712 --> 07:39.815
But we have to figure out
但我们必须弄清楚

07:39.884 --> 07:41.608
what you have
so we can treat it.
你有什么
这样我们就可以治疗它。

07:41.677 --> 07:44.126
No, uh, I already know
what I have.
不，呃，我已经知道了
我有什么。

07:44.195 --> 07:47.195
It's, uh, acute...
这，呃，很尖锐……

07:47.264 --> 07:50.402
spotting... sclorboritis.
发现... 菌毛炎。

07:50.471 --> 07:53.539
Acute spotting sclorboritis?
急性点状菌毛炎？

07:53.608 --> 07:55.953
I never heard of that one.
Better look it up.
我从来没有听说过那个。
最好查一下。

07:57.746 --> 07:59.988
Ah-choo, ah-choo, ah-choo!
啊，啊，啊，啊！

08:00.057 --> 08:01.471
Oh, you're getting worse!
哎呀，你越来越坏了！

08:01.539 --> 08:04.471
We've got to find a cure fast.
我们必须尽快找到治疗方法。

08:04.539 --> 08:06.402
I found it. Here it is.
我找到了。这里是。

08:07.643 --> 08:09.229
- You did?
- Yup.
- 你做到了？
- 是的。

08:09.298 --> 08:10.712
And the cure
seems pretty simple.
还有治愈方法
看起来很简单。

08:10.781 --> 08:12.126
See?
看？

08:12.195 --> 08:13.608
Uh... uh, wait...
呃……呃，等等……

08:13.677 --> 08:15.884
wait, did I say acute
spotting sclorboritis?
等等，我说的是急性吗
发现毛球炎？

08:15.953 --> 08:21.057
No, no, I must've meant...
plerkington's syndrome.
不不不，我的意思一定是……
普勒金顿综合症。

08:21.884 --> 08:25.333
Found it. Now, let's get
to the curing, shall we?
找到了。现在，让我们得到
去治愈，好吗？

08:25.402 --> 08:29.988
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

08:30.057 --> 08:32.126
Aah!
啊啊！

08:32.195 --> 08:38.022
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:38.091 --> 08:39.298
Huh?
啊？

08:43.160 --> 08:46.539
[Squidward gagging]
[章鱼哥作呕]

08:53.712 --> 08:56.298
- Are we done?
- Don't be silly.
- 我们完成了吗？
- 别傻了。

08:56.367 --> 08:58.229
We've just begun.
我们才刚刚开始。

08:58.298 --> 08:59.850
Aah!
啊啊！

08:59.919 --> 09:01.539
[ringing]
[铃声]

09:01.608 --> 09:03.574
Tentacles residence.
SpongeBob speaking.
触手居住地。
海绵宝宝在说话。

09:03.643 --> 09:04.953
<i>Hello, me boy-o.</i>
<i>你好，我的孩子。</i>

09:05.022 --> 09:08.781
<i>How's the patient?
- Better. I'm all better.</i>
<i>病人怎么样了？
- 更好的。我好多了。</i>

09:08.850 --> 09:11.712
Please, just let me
go back to work.
请让我
回去工作吧。

09:11.781 --> 09:15.815
<i>Oh, nonsense.
You still look so sick.</i>
<i>哦，废话。
你看起来还是那么病态。</i>

09:15.884 --> 09:18.022
<i>Better step up the cure,
SpongeBob.</i>
<i>更好地加强治疗，
海绵宝宝。</i>

09:18.091 --> 09:19.884
Whatever you say Mr. Krabs.
不管你说什么，蟹老板。

09:27.333 --> 09:28.781
Open wide.
敞开。

09:30.264 --> 09:33.539
You will not get that
anywhere near my mouth.
你不会明白的
靠近我嘴的任何地方。

09:33.608 --> 09:35.677
Ha ha ha ha!
Guess again.
哈哈哈哈！
再猜一下。

09:35.746 --> 09:38.919
<i>Aah!</i>
<i>啊！</i>

09:39.298 --> 09:40.895
<i>So, the book told me
to stretch his nose,</i>
<i>所以，这本书告诉我
伸展他的鼻子，</i>

09:40.919 --> 09:43.067
shock him with a jellyfish,
and then I scraped his lungs
用水母吓他一跳，
然后我刮了他的肺

09:43.091 --> 09:44.988
and cleaned them out
with a toxic eating urchin.
并清理掉它们
与有毒的食海胆。

09:45.057 --> 09:49.298
Hoo hoo hoo hoo.
Hee he hee hee!
呼呼呼呼。
嘿嘿嘿嘿！

09:49.367 --> 09:50.781
Priceless.
无价。

09:54.195 --> 09:55.608
Well, Mr. Squidward.
好吧，章鱼哥先生。

09:55.677 --> 09:58.126
Feeling better
after your sick day?
感觉好多了
病假后？

09:58.195 --> 10:00.712
You might say that.
你可能会这么说。

10:04.195 --> 10:08.643
[gasps] He's glorious.
[喘气]他很光荣。

10:08.712 --> 10:11.884
That's right, I used to be
sick of everything,
没错，我曾经也是
厌倦了一切，

10:11.953 --> 10:13.781
but I'm not sick anymore.
但我不再生病了。

10:13.850 --> 10:17.160
I've been plagued by toxins
and stress built up
我一直被毒素困扰
和压力的积累

10:17.229 --> 10:18.953
over the years at this job,
多年来从事这份工作，

10:19.022 --> 10:22.022
but SpongeBob washed those away.
但海绵宝宝把它们洗掉了。

10:22.091 --> 10:23.781
[squeals]
[尖叫声]

10:25.057 --> 10:29.712
Now, who wants to order?
Ha ha ha!
现在，谁想订购？
哈哈哈！

10:29.781 --> 10:32.643
[overlapping shouting]
[重叠的喊叫]

10:32.712 --> 10:34.574
- Ha ha ha ha.
- Hey, Squidward.
- 哈哈哈哈。
- 嘿，章鱼哥。

10:34.643 --> 10:36.471
Whoa, muscles.
哇，肌肉。

10:36.539 --> 10:38.402
Hey, Squidward.
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。
嘿，章鱼哥。

10:38.471 --> 10:40.539
More layered pie.
更有层次感的馅饼。

10:42.850 --> 10:46.057
Hey, Squidward.
- No, no, no!
嘿，章鱼哥。
- 不，不，不！

10:48.746 --> 10:52.694
I think I'm going to be sick.
我想我会生病的。

我想我会生病的。